# ── Confidentiality defense-in-depth ──────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo holds ONLY the sanitized, gate-passed render surface. Nothing internal
# may ever enter git history. These patterns block the most common leak sources even
# if a file is accidentally copied into the repo.

# Secrets / tokens
.secrets/
*.key
*.token
.env
.vercel/

# Tasklet-internal pipeline (lives in atlas-external/, NEVER in this repo)
build.py
route_network.py
build_safe.sh
partition/
output-external/
output-internal/
boarding-points/
route-demand-config.json
routing/

# Internal source-of-truth & logs
*humans*.json
_subagent-learnings.md
_conveyor-learnings.md
conveyor-runs/
city-dossiers/
reference/
world-map/

# Absolute-exclusion canaries (any file whose name carries these never belongs here)
*data-spine-SCHEMA*
*internal*
*-quarantine-*

# Build artifacts you may want to keep out of merge churn
_dist/
node_modules/
*.zip
